{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04410","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三十六 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩然坐何慕，吾蜀有峨眉。\n念与楚狂子，悠悠白云期。\n时哉悲不会，涕泣久涟洏。\n梦登绥山穴，南采巫山芝。\n探元观羣化，遗世从云螭。\n婉变时永矣，感悟不见之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}